flowchart LR
  F[src/levels/id.json] --> V{validateLevel}
  V -- invalid --> X[error: blank canvas message]
  V -- ok --> S[applySize k: tiles kxk, positions x k, mice and ammo x k, Pete not duplicated]
  S --> D[applyDifficulty: hp speed count every regHp ammo drop]
  D --> C[createGame level]
  C --> FF[buildFlowField to live registers]
  C --> WS[wave scheduler]
  WS -- delay then groups every N s --> SP[spawn mouse / one pete at spawn id]
  SP --> E[vermin follow flow field]
  E --> DMG[bite registers]
  DMG -- register_lost --> FF
  WS -- vermin cleared --> CB[clearBonus then intermission then next wave]
  CB -- wave start --> FF
  CB -- final wave cleared --> WIN[victory]
  DMG -- loseWhen all or any --> LOSE[defeat]
  WIN --> SC[score x difficulty x size -> scores store]
  LOSE --> SC
